            "created_at": "2025-09-21T22:29:30.637518+00:00",
            "notes": "The Supply surge build is basically just the first 2 powers so you have some freedom with what you take here but I like [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) + [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) gameplay\n\n[Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) provides quick access to Triage and good mobility so I take it even if the AP does nothing for you yet. \n\nWith triage, you'll have some freedom to wait until your tank is critical health before healing them here and there - this way you maximize time spent boosting.",
